# =============================================================================
# ATLAS ASCEND — environment
# =============================================================================
# Copy to `.env.local` for development. Set the same values in the Vercel
# dashboard (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) for deployment.
#
# `.env.local` is gitignored. Never commit a real token.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the browser bundle at build time and
# are therefore PUBLIC. Never put a secret behind that prefix.
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED — the map does not render without this
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mapbox public access token (starts with `pk.`).
# Create at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
#
# This ships to the browser by design. Protect it in the Mapbox dashboard with
# a URL restriction for your production domain rather than by hiding it.
#
# Without it, Atlas Ascend still runs and renders a designed "map unavailable"
# state — it does not crash, and it does not pretend to have a map.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL — place search
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-only Mapbox token used by /api/search for geocoding.
#
# Geocoding is billed per request, so it is worth a separate, more tightly
# scoped token than the public map one. If unset, the search route falls back
# to NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN.
MAPBOX_TOKEN=


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT YET USED — reserved for the next phase
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Atlas natural-language intelligence. Until this is set, Atlas runs on its
# deterministic rule set only and says so rather than improvising.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Persistence. Vehicles and destinations are currently stored in the browser
# only. See ARCHITECTURE.md for the intended Postgres + auth setup.
# DATABASE_URL=
